{
    "word": "phantasmal",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "1926ea71-2ae0-3ead-8892-9309b11774a3",
                "word": "phantasmal",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "e9fc5e16-52c8-4d3f-b403-032faeb6f5f3",
                        "entry_id": "1926ea71-2ae0-3ead-8892-9309b11774a3",
                        "tags": [
                            "comparative"
                        ],
                        "form": "more phantasmal"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "addae8ce-054c-41fe-a884-63f4cbb75699",
                        "entry_id": "1926ea71-2ae0-3ead-8892-9309b11774a3",
                        "tags": [
                            "superlative"
                        ],
                        "form": "most phantasmal"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e75572b5-52b5-3c7a-9eb5-1c083dd8aef8",
                        "entry_id": "1926ea71-2ae0-3ead-8892-9309b11774a3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Of or pertaining to, or having the characteristics of, a phantasm (“something seen but having no physical reality”); imaginary, unreal."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b586b7c2-cabc-49f3-a08e-700857a5a6fc",
                                "sense_id": "e75572b5-52b5-3c7a-9eb5-1c083dd8aef8",
                                "text": "The matter of which dreams are made / Not more endowed with actual life / Than this phantasmal portraiture / Of wandering human thought."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c065206a-3875-476a-b58c-7e8a38ba971d",
                                "sense_id": "e75572b5-52b5-3c7a-9eb5-1c083dd8aef8",
                                "text": "Mr. Audley, the chairman, was an amiable, elderly man who still wore Gladstone collars; he was a kind of symbol of all that phantasmal and yet fixed society."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "09ccb22e-e7a7-428a-a031-2c414a0850ab",
                                "sense_id": "e75572b5-52b5-3c7a-9eb5-1c083dd8aef8",
                                "text": "[H]e had heard about him the constant voices of his father and of his masters, urging him to be a gentleman above all things and urging him to be a good catholic above all things. […] And it was the din of all these hollowsounding voices that made him halt irresolutely in the pursuit of phantoms. He gave them ear only for a time but he was happy only when he was far from them, beyond their call, alone or in the company of phantasmal comrades."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bc117147-8ebf-47dd-89b7-7125871a5a81",
                                "sense_id": "e75572b5-52b5-3c7a-9eb5-1c083dd8aef8",
                                "text": "Her secrets: old feather fans, tassled dancecards, powdered with musk, a gaud of amber beads in her locked drawer. […] Phantasmal mirth, folded away: muskperfumed."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e0175137-825e-3145-8c72-e41b2c3130b8",
                        "entry_id": "1926ea71-2ae0-3ead-8892-9309b11774a3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Of or pertaining to, or having the characteristics of, a phantasm (“something seen but having no physical reality”); imaginary, unreal.",
                            "Of or pertaining to, or having the characteristics of, a phantom (“apparition or ghost”); ghostly, spectral."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "22234ff1-8798-3da8-8749-3f6d4f934c4f",
                        "entry_id": "1926ea71-2ae0-3ead-8892-9309b11774a3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Of or pertaining to, or having the characteristics of, a phantasm (“something seen but having no physical reality”); imaginary, unreal.",
                            "Of or pertaining to, or having the characteristics of, a phantasm (“perception or vision of a living or dead person who is not physically present, often through telepathy”)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "83d677af-13fb-4bfe-896e-3ee7c5a15102",
                        "source_entry_id": "1926ea71-2ae0-3ead-8892-9309b11774a3",
                        "source_sense_description": "of or pertaining to, or having the characteristics of, a phantom — see also ghostly, spectral",
                        "target_lang_word": "fantasmatique",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "fantasmatique",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4d8f5bfb-7154-3d7f-ba05-c0e7f1737306",
                                        "entry_id": "61dc57b1-aa2f-33f8-b3b4-f23e7ac3b7ee",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui présente un caractère irréel, fantomatique."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "606fed00-44e2-408a-9bd6-7fc6b60ca471",
                                                "sense_id": "4d8f5bfb-7154-3d7f-ba05-c0e7f1737306",
                                                "text": "Les morts, au nombre de quarante environ, sont rangés debout autour du caveau et adossés contre la muraille ; cette attitude perpendiculaire, qui contraste avec l’horizontalité habituelle des cadavres, leur donne une apparence de vie fantasmatique très-effrayante, surtout à la lumière jaune et tremblante de la lanterne qui oscille dans la main du guide et déplace les ombres d’un instant à l’autre."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "38a9bbd7-eff5-4095-b2d9-d832c5518485",
                                                "sense_id": "4d8f5bfb-7154-3d7f-ba05-c0e7f1737306",
                                                "text": "Cette lugubre dalle calviniste, sans croix, avec le seul nom terrifiant et fantasmatique de Louis XVII."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4d46ae9d-2117-3fff-bb63-589d060c507c",
                                        "entry_id": "61dc57b1-aa2f-33f8-b3b4-f23e7ac3b7ee",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui relève du fantasme."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5f3eefe2-244e-4194-add4-e60ea532be9f",
                                                "sense_id": "4d46ae9d-2117-3fff-bb63-589d060c507c",
                                                "text": "[La langue poétique] dépôt de toutes les poésies antérieures, image fantastique (ou fantasmatique) d’un patrimoine qui n’est pas celui de l’auteur."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ec8defc7-0b2f-43c4-bda1-2f9a708efc4d",
                                                "sense_id": "4d46ae9d-2117-3fff-bb63-589d060c507c",
                                                "text": "Le toxicomane voit son intérieur, il voit son extérieur. […] il préfère ce qui se passe en lui parce que, après tout, cela lui appartient. Alors se créent les monstres des délires fantasmatiques."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4fbbbf11-1608-4e3a-95b5-44980508773e",
                                                "sense_id": "4d46ae9d-2117-3fff-bb63-589d060c507c",
                                                "text": "Lucile avait quarante-neuf ans, un anglais approximatif et une maîtrise de l’outil informatique bien plus limitée que dans ses élucubrations fantasmatiques."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e022ba01-fbd8-4910-9781-796f051f1326",
                                                "sense_id": "4d46ae9d-2117-3fff-bb63-589d060c507c",
                                                "text": "L’identité nationale intervient alors précisément comme un cache-sexe, pour focaliser des attentions, des désirs, des pulsions sur un objet réduit à son expression fantasmatique."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
